Short:        Documentation and FAQs for Amiga Minix
Author:       Andrew S. Tanenbaum, Raymond Michiels, Steven Reiz and Johan W. Stevenson
Uploader:     aminet aminet net
Type:         misc/os
Version:      1.5.10
Architecture: generic

This archive contains the full documentation for Amiga Minix 1.5 in PDF format,
plus a few text files with FAQs and announcements.

Contents:

contents.pdf    - TABLE OF CONTENTS 
intro.pdf       - Chapter 1. INTRODUCTION (all platforms) 
installing.pdf  - Chapter 4. MINIX ON THE COMMODORE AMIGA 
using.pdf       - Chapter 6. USING MINIX (all platforms) 
recompiling.pdf - Chapter 7. RECOMPILING MINIX (all platforms) 
demoman.pdf     - Reference Manual for the MINIX 1.5 Demo Disk (all platforms) 
manpage1.zip    - Updated Manual Pages 
manpage2.zip    - Updated Manual Pages

MINIX_answers.txt - by Steven Reiz & Raymond Michiels (Date: 1989-07-25)
AMINIX15_FAQ.txt  - by Steven Reiz (Date: 1990-09-24)
Announcement.txt  - Minix announcement/information sheet
MINIX_final.txt   - Minix final version announcement

LICENSE.txt       - The Minix license
